# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FAERIE-HIVE-PLUGIN — Build/Runtime Environment
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Legend:
#   [REQUIRED]            → must be set for the app to start
#   [OPTIONAL: <feature>] → only needed if you use that feature
#   [DEV] / [PROD]        → environment-specific
#   [SECRET]              → do NOT share. Rotate if leaked.
#
# faerie-hive-plugin is the Obsidian plugin. At runtime its config comes
# from the vault (~/.faerie-token + .obsidian/plugins/hive/data.json). This
# file carries the BUILD-TIME defaults injected into main.js via esbuild.
# Distributable copies should be built with these defaults; end users can
# still override per-vault via the plugin settings UI.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── BUILD-TIME DEFAULTS (esbuild --define) ────────────────────────────────
# [OPTIONAL] Default MCP server URL baked into the plugin. Users override
# in their vault's plugin settings or via ~/.faerie-token alongside.
MCP_URL=https://your-mcp-server.example.com

# [DEV] Local-dev override — flip to localhost when bundling a dev build.
# MCP_URL=http://localhost:8080

# [OPTIONAL] Plugin build channel — stable | beta | dev. Affects update
# manifest URL the plugin advertises.
PLUGIN_CHANNEL=stable

# ─── DEV TOKEN (NEVER ship in dist build) ──────────────────────────────────
# [DEV][SECRET] Token used for local plugin testing. The CI build pipeline
# MUST strip this before publishing main.js to the manifest channel.
# FAERIE_API_TOKEN=
